  "source": "Home Office Immigration Statistics, year ending March 2026 (released 21 May 2026): Asy_D01 (claims), Ret_D01 (returns), and asylum-grant-rates.json (lifted from asylumstats, derived from Asy_D02 with appeal uplift from FT-IAC outcomes). Joined with DWP Stat-Xplore NINo flow rolling year ending Q4 2025.",
  "lastUpdated": "2026-05-27",
